[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644301356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102544#issuecomment-2644301356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102544","id":2644301356,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dnNYs","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T23:15:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T13:34:03Z","body":"I simplified the MRP a bit, mainly to not require a Blender import, but also to rule out a few things: [jolt-ghost-collision.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18715262/jolt-ghost-collision.zip)\n\nI have...\n\n- Created a new `ConcavePolygonShape3D` based on a subdivided `PlaneMesh`\n- Reset all the project settings\n- Reset all the properties of the `RigidBody3D`, including the axis locks\n- Set friction to zero for the `RigidBody3D`\n- Changed it to apply only an initial linear velocity to the `RigidBody3D`\n\nDespite all that, the ghost collisions seem to generally persist, albeit at different places.\n\nThis one has me scratching my head a bit, @jrouwe. As best I can tell there seems to be something odd going on with `mEnhancedInternalEdgeRemoval`, as disabling it using the `physics/jolt_physics_3d/simulation/use_enhanced_internal_edge_removal` project setting (and thus falling back on the active edge detection) resolves the ghost collisions.\n\nI'm able to recreate the issue in Jolt's `Samples` application using a snapshot as well: [jolt_snapshot_2025-02-07_23-47-36_4462471020544.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18715012/jolt_snapshot_2025-02-07_23-47-36_4462471020544.zip)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d7a61eb-b0f3-4626-bc25-a43db1285224","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644301356/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2645756508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102544#issuecomment-2645756508","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102544","id":2645756508,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dswpc","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T15:00:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T15:00:15Z","body":"When tinkering with some other subdivisions, the problem does seem to be related to the size of the triangles in some way.\n\nHere's another version of the above revised MRP, with some different triangle densities:  [jolt-ghost-collision.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18719226/jolt-ghost-collision.zip)\n\n... which looks like this:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d2db9b6-7c5a-4b70-866e-5ff1d1b72210\n\nHere's a snapshot of that scene (right after applying the impulses): [jolt_snapshot_2025-02-08_15-53-14_4578435137536.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18719229/jolt_snapshot_2025-02-08_15-53-14_4578435137536.zip)\n\n... which looks like this in Jolt's `Samples` application:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56a10450-834c-4dbb-8652-2bfc93a5a13b","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2645756508/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2645959119","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102544#issuecomment-2645959119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102544","id":2645959119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dtiHP","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https: